# Create Sheet

::summary
The shared describe-it create sheet (`name=create`) — the generic New sheet behind every surface's ＋. One modal whose title and body swap per kind: New Doc (describe → Generate seeds the Surfy composer; blank-doc escape), New Tasks (goal breakdown → Review Tasks → manual escape), New App (describe → Generate prefills the Surfy panel; no manual path — apps are built by Surfy). No type-picker menus anywhere (RULED 08-03: iOS CreatePromptSheet parity). This file is the ONLY definition of the sheet — `surfaces/docs.surf`, `surfaces/tasks.surf`, and `surfaces/apps.surf` open it via `openCreateDoc` / `openCreateTasks` / `openCreateApp` and carry no inline copies. Stable name `create` (matches this file's stem).
::

## Frame — New Doc kind shown

::modal[name=create title="New Doc" width=340 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::form[name=create-describe submit="Generate" action=generateFromDescription]
- Describe (textarea, "Describe your doc — Surfy will draft it…") *
:::

:::toolbar
- button[label="Create a blank doc instead" action=createBlankDoc]
:::

::

## Kind variants

| Kind | Title | Describe placeholder | Primary | Escape |
|------|-------|----------------------|---------|--------|
| Doc | New Doc | "Describe your doc — Surfy will draft it…" | Generate (action=generateFromDescription) | "Create a blank doc instead" → title + content form |
| Tasks | New Tasks | "e.g. Launch the iOS beta: Beta Track build, onboarding screens, crash reporting…" under the "Describe your goals" head | Break into tasks (action=breakIntoTasks) → Review Tasks step | "Create task manually instead" → name + description + type form |
| App | New App | "Describe the app — Surfy will build it…" | Generate (action=generateAppFromDescription) — prefills the Surfy panel, opens it if closed, never auto-sends | none — no by-hand app create |

The Tasks kind's second step (Review Tasks) renders proposed-task cards: include checkbox (unchecked dims to 0.45), editable name, type select; footer Regenerate (action=regenerateTaskBreakdown) + primary "Add N" (action=addReviewedTasks, count tracks the checkboxes).

Every primary stays disabled until text; top-right ✕ per dismiss canon.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
